Here is the input problem:
  Axiom 1 (not_2): not(true) = false.
  Axiom 2 (not_1): not(false) = true.
  Axiom 3 (isGT_1): isGT(lt) = false.
  Axiom 4 (isGT_2): isGT(eq) = false.
  Axiom 5 (isGT_3): isGT(gt) = true.
  Axiom 6 (compareNat_1): compareNat(zero, zero) = eq.
  Axiom 7 (compareNat_2): compareNat(zero, suc(X)) = lt.
  Axiom 8 (compareNat_3): compareNat(suc(X), zero) = gt.
  Axiom 9 (compareNat_4): compareNat(suc(X), suc(Y)) = compareNat(X, Y).
  Axiom 10 (eqNat_1): eqNat(zero, zero) = true.
  Axiom 11 (eqNat_2): eqNat(zero, suc(X)) = false.
  Axiom 12 (eqNat_3): eqNat(suc(X), zero) = false.
  Axiom 13 (eqNat_4): eqNat(suc(X), suc(Y)) = eqNat(X, Y).
  Axiom 14 (maxNat_case1_1): maxNat_case1(true, X, Y) = Y.
  Axiom 15 (maxNat_case1_2): maxNat_case1(false, X, Y) = X.
  Axiom 16 (leNat_1): leNat(X, Y) = not(isGT(compareNat(X, Y))).
  Axiom 17 (prop_maxLeft_case1_1): prop_maxLeft_case1(true, X, Y) = eqNat(maxNat(Y, X), X).
  Axiom 18 (prop_maxLeft_case1_2): prop_maxLeft_case1(false, X, Y) = eqNat(maxNat(Y, X), X).
  Axiom 19 (prop_maxLeft_1): prop_maxLeft(X, Y) = prop_maxLeft_case1(leNat(X, Y), Y, X).
  Axiom 20 (maxNat_1): maxNat(X, Y) = maxNat_case1(leNat(X, Y), X, Y).
  Axiom 21 (reflexivity): equals(X, X) = true.
  Axiom 22 (prop_maxLeft): equals(prop_maxLeft(X, Y), false) = false.
  Goal 1 (true_equals_false): true = false.

1. not(true) -> false
2. not(false) -> true
3. isGT(lt) -> false
4. isGT(eq) -> false
5. isGT(gt) -> true
6. compareNat(zero, zero) -> eq
7. compareNat(zero, suc(X)) -> lt
8. compareNat(suc(X), zero) -> gt
9. compareNat(suc(X), suc(Y)) -> compareNat(X, Y)
10. eqNat(zero, zero) -> true
11. eqNat(zero, suc(X)) -> false
12. eqNat(suc(X), zero) -> false
13. eqNat(suc(X), suc(Y)) -> eqNat(X, Y)
14. maxNat_case1(true, X, Y) -> Y
15. maxNat_case1(false, X, Y) -> X
16. not(isGT(compareNat(X, Y))) -> leNat(X, Y)
17. eqNat(maxNat(X, Y), Y) -> prop_maxLeft_case1(true, Y, X)
18. prop_maxLeft_case1(false, X, Y) -> prop_maxLeft_case1(true, X, Y)
19. prop_maxLeft_case1(leNat(X, Y), Y, X) -> prop_maxLeft(X, Y)
20. maxNat_case1(leNat(X, Y), X, Y) -> maxNat(X, Y)
21. equals(X, X) -> true
22. equals(prop_maxLeft(X, Y), false) -> false
23. leNat(zero, zero) -> true
24. maxNat(zero, zero) -> zero
25. leNat(zero, suc(X)) -> true
26. leNat(suc(X), zero) -> false
27. maxNat(zero, suc(X)) -> suc(X)
28. maxNat(suc(X), zero) -> suc(X)
29. prop_maxLeft_case1(true, zero, zero) -> prop_maxLeft(zero, zero)
30. prop_maxLeft(zero, zero) -> true
31. equals(true, false) -> false
32. leNat(suc(X), suc(Y)) -> leNat(X, Y)
33. prop_maxLeft_case1(true, zero, suc(X)) -> false
34. prop_maxLeft_case1(true, suc(X), zero) -> prop_maxLeft(zero, suc(X))
35. prop_maxLeft(suc(X), zero) -> false
36. false -> true

The conjecture is true! Here is a proof.

Axiom 1 (not_2): not(true) = false.
Axiom 2 (isGT_3): isGT(gt) = true.
Axiom 3 (compareNat_3): compareNat(suc(X), zero) = gt.
Axiom 4 (eqNat_3): eqNat(suc(X), zero) = false.
Axiom 5 (maxNat_case1_2): maxNat_case1(false, X, Y) = X.
Axiom 6 (leNat_1): leNat(X, Y) = not(isGT(compareNat(X, Y))).
Axiom 7 (prop_maxLeft_case1_2): prop_maxLeft_case1(false, X, Y) = eqNat(maxNat(Y, X), X).
Axiom 8 (prop_maxLeft_1): prop_maxLeft(X, Y) = prop_maxLeft_case1(leNat(X, Y), Y, X).
Axiom 9 (maxNat_1): maxNat(X, Y) = maxNat_case1(leNat(X, Y), X, Y).

Lemma 10: leNat(suc(X), zero) = false.
Proof:
  leNat(suc(X), zero)
= { by axiom 6 (leNat_1) }
  not(isGT(compareNat(suc(X), zero)))
= { by axiom 3 (compareNat_3) }
  not(isGT(gt))
= { by axiom 2 (isGT_3) }
  not(true)
= { by axiom 1 (not_2) }
  false

Goal 1 (prop_maxLeft): prop_maxLeft(X, Y) = false.
The goal is true when:
  X = suc(X)
  Y = zero

Proof:
  prop_maxLeft(suc(X), zero)
= { by axiom 8 (prop_maxLeft_1) }
  prop_maxLeft_case1(leNat(suc(X), zero), zero, suc(X))
= { by lemma 10 }
  prop_maxLeft_case1(false, zero, suc(X))
= { by axiom 7 (prop_maxLeft_case1_2) }
  eqNat(maxNat(suc(X), zero), zero)
= { by axiom 9 (maxNat_1) }
  eqNat(maxNat_case1(leNat(suc(X), zero), suc(X), zero), zero)
= { by lemma 10 }
  eqNat(maxNat_case1(false, suc(X), zero), zero)
= { by axiom 5 (maxNat_case1_2) }
  eqNat(suc(X), zero)
= { by axiom 4 (eqNat_3) }
  false

RESULT: Theorem (the conjecture is true).
